{%- comment -%}
  lx-kopf-pfad (11.11.2026): Pfad (Breadcrumb samt JSON-LD, Logik und Text unveraendert aus lux_breadcrumb) und Versandzeile
  (Inhalt unveraendert aus lux_usp_coll) in einem Abschnitt. Aufruf im Custom-Liquid-Abschnitt lux_breadcrumb: render 'lx-kopf-pfad';
  lux_usp_coll entfaellt dann. Handy (bis 749 px): Pfad und Versandzeile in EINER waagrecht scrollenden Zeile.
  Desktop: wie bisher (Pfad, darunter die Versandzeile).
  15.11.2026 (Korrektur): am Handy zeigt der Pfad nur noch die Eltern-Kategorie («‹ Schmuck & Uhren»; ohne Eltern «‹ Home»).
  «Home ›» und der Titel der Seite (steht direkt darunter als H1) sind dort ausgeblendet, damit die Versandzeile im Bild steht.
  JSON-LD und Desktop unveraendert.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign p_title = ''
  assign p_url = ''
  for link in linklists.main-menu.links
    for sub in link.links
      if sub.url == collection.url and p_title == ''
        assign p_title = link.title
        assign p_url = link.url
      endif
      for sub2 in sub.links
        if sub2.url == collection.url and p_title == ''
          assign p_title = sub.title
          assign p_url = sub.url
        endif
      endfor
    endfor
  endfor
-%}
<style>.lx-usp{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;max-width:var(--page-width,1200px);margin:0 auto;padding:.5rem 1.5rem}.lx-usp__reihe{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(185px,1fr));gap:.7rem 1.2rem;padding:.8rem 0;border-top:1px solid #ece4d6;border-bottom:1px solid #ece4d6;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.03em;color:#2c2c2c;line-height:1.4}.lx-usp__eintrag{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.6rem}.lx-usp__eintrag svg{flex:0 0 auto;color:#8b7355}.lx-usp__eintrag strong{font-weight:600;color:#2c2c2c}@media(max-width:749px){.lx-usp{padding:.25rem 1rem}.lx-usp__reihe{display:flex;overflow-x:auto;gap:1.4rem;padding:.55rem 0;font-size:12.5px;scrollbar-width:none;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch}.lx-usp__reihe::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}.lx-usp__eintrag{flex:0 0 auto;white-space:nowrap;gap:.4rem}.lx-usp__eintrag svg{width:16px;height:16px}}</style>
<style>
.lx-kp__pfad{max-width:var(--page-width,1200px);margin:0 auto;padding:.4rem 1.5rem 0;font-size:.95rem;font-weight:600;line-height:1.4;color:#3d2f18;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.3rem;align-items:center;box-sizing:border-box}
.lx-kp__pfad a{color:#6b4f1d;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
.lx-kp__pfad [aria-current="page"]{color:#1f1a12;font-weight:700}
@media (max-width:749px){
.lx-kp{display:flex;align-items:center;overflow-x:auto;overscroll-behavior-x:contain;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;scrollbar-width:none;margin-inline:calc(-1 * var(--page-margin,16px));padding:5px var(--page-margin,16px);gap:0;white-space:nowrap}
.lx-kp::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}
.lx-kp nav.lx-kp__pfad{flex:0 0 auto;flex-wrap:nowrap;max-width:none;margin:0;padding:0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.4}
.lx-kp .lx-usp{flex:0 0 auto;width:auto;max-width:none;margin:0 0 0 12px;padding:0 0 0 12px;border-left:1px solid #d9cdb8}
.lx-kp .lx-usp__reihe{border:0;padding:0;overflow:visible;gap:1.1rem}
.lx-kp .lx-kp__weg{display:none}
.lx-kp .lx-kp__hoch::before{content:"\2039\00a0";content:"\2039\00a0" / ""}
}
/* lx-1511a */@media(max-width:749px){.lx-kp{-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000 86%,transparent);mask-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#000 86%,transparent)}}
</style>
<div class="lx-kp">
  <nav class="lx-kp__pfad" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
  <a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="{% if p_title != blank %}lx-kp__weg{% else %}lx-kp__hoch{% endif %}">Home</a>
  {%- if p_title != blank %}<span aria-hidden="true" class="lx-kp__weg">&rsaquo;</span>
  <a href="{{ p_url }}" class="lx-kp__hoch">{{ p_title | strip }}</a>{% endif -%}
  <span aria-hidden="true" class="lx-kp__weg">&rsaquo;</span>
  <span aria-current="page" class="lx-kp__weg">{{ collection.title }}</span>
</nav>
  <div class="lx-usp"><div class="lx-usp__reihe"><span class="lx-usp__eintrag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2"/><path d="M15 18H9"/><path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14"/><circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2"/><circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2"/></svg><span><strong>Gratis-Versand</strong> in der Schweiz ab CHF 50 nach Rabatt</span></span><span class="lx-usp__eintrag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8"/><path d="M3 3v5h5"/></svg><span>{% if collection.handle contains 'selbst-gestalten' or collection.handle == 'sg-bekleidung' or collection.handle == 'sg-taschen' or collection.handle == 'sg-wohnen' or collection.handle == 'sg-trinken' or collection.handle == 'sg-accessoires' %}<strong>Ersatz</strong> bei Druckfehlern{% elsif collection.handle == 'sg-alle' %}<strong>30 Tage</strong> Rückgabe (ausser selbst gestaltete Artikel){% else %}<strong>30 Tage</strong> Rückgabe{% endif %}</span></span><span class="lx-usp__eintrag"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="32" height="32" rx="4" fill="#d52b1e"/><path fill="#fff" d="M13 6h6v7h7v6h-7v7h-6v-7H6v-6h7z"/></svg><span><strong>Schweizer Shop</strong></span></span><span class="lx-usp__eintrag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg><span><strong>Sichere Zahlung</strong> · TWINT</span></span><span class="lx-usp__eintrag"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="8" width="18" height="4" rx="1"/><path d="M12 8v13"/><path d="M19 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-7"/><path d="M7.5 8a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0-5A4.8 8 0 0 1 12 8a4.8 8 0 0 1 4.5-5 2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5"/></svg><span><strong>–10 %</strong> mit WELCOME10</span></span></div></div>
</div>
<script type="application/ld+json">
{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[
{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ routes.root_url }}"}{%- if p_title != blank %},
{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":{{ p_title | strip | json }},"item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ p_url }}"},
{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":{{ collection.title | json }},"item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}"}{% else %},
{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":{{ collection.title | json }},"item":"{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}"}{% endif -%}
]}
</script>
